{"server":"tw","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_10_end","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_10","title":"再見，再見","storyCode":"BB-10","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_10_end.txt","sourceHash":"628e1cb1af84a5151ed1b51150eb081f448b51e4ef0bee21a8d823fd09ca2e01","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"特蕾西婭拉著眼前之人的手，就像他們的第一次見面。\n她靜靜與那雙眼睛對視，看到其中不停變換著情緒，最終，只留下空洞一片。\n她知道，最後的記憶已經抹去，靈魂已經純淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的記憶已經死去，你的靈魂會重生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是可怕的技倆……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可那些人低估了你的善良，低估了你對勝利的渴望。那些人低估了我們，低估了泰拉堅忍至今的起源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，姑且再讓我最後一次如此稱呼你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我對你小小的報復。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也是我對你……最後的饋贈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"記憶從不塑造你自己。以你最本來的面目……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……重新生活在……大地之上吧。去看看這個世界，去感受生活的喜怒哀樂，去結識形形色色的泰拉人民……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許……你的旅程會從苦難中開始，總是離不開這片大地昏沉的月影，可你總能……見到太陽升起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我相信，你會重新得出一個答案。得出真正屬於你的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那一定……和凱爾希，和我曾聽到的那段呢喃一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"令人熱淚盈眶吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"narration","text":"生命在流逝。\n她的耳邊逐漸響起了來自遠方的輓歌。對了，菈瑪蓮曾與她設下連接。\n特蕾西婭自己的氣息在逐漸微弱……但她也感受到了前所未有的輕鬆。\n她盡力將阿米婭護在懷中，保護著。阿米婭的心跳令她安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我有點累了，捧住那頂冠冕真的很累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"累了就得休息，對吧，阿米婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我曾想過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也許有天……我們會一起讓這片大地上的每一個人，都能平靜入夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很遙遠，但也許，你會替我看到那一天……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，當你醒來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你就要繼續前行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——好累……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，她還沒有來……"},{"type":"narration","text":"她只有最後一絲珍貴的力氣了。\n她有必須要等的人。\n萬幸，她已經聽到了那人趕來的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"終於，哪怕無力再睜開眼，但她也知道——\n那人回來了——\n凱爾希……\n凱爾希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭……博士……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明知道這樣的可能性始終存在……為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該留下，是我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾……西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我們本可以……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭……確認死……死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，聽我命令……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備……應對後續的襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士和阿米婭……不能再出事……不能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭睜開了眼，瞳孔中隱隱現出粉色的菱形。\n特蕾西婭依舊緊閉雙眼。\n但凱爾希知道。\n這就是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希……我一直在等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭！我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，沒事的，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽我說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你現在看到的，是我寄留於王冠中的意識，藉由這個孩子的身體與你告別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，告訴我，你是否將那面巴別塔旗幟升上了卡茲戴爾的天空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我將它送回卡茲戴爾了，我看著它升上了高空……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我回來得太晚了，我明知道有這種可能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要為此自責，凱爾希，你有自己的任務需要完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且在最後……我還是等到你了，這已經足夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我們，沒有更多時間告別了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，凱爾希……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請不要責怪自己，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們曾信任過博士，我希望你能在未來繼續沿著我們的道路前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，不必再為此而疑慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我殺死了他，也救下了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請將他送回他應在的地方，如果他還能醒來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"指引他，他會帶領我們走到我們道路的終點——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我深信不疑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但……我們不能再冒險進入……羅德島的深處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會拜託一位熟人，將博士送到烏薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在切爾諾伯格，他會被安置得很好。博士繼續留在羅德島，風險……太高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣很好……凱爾希。那以後的事情，就要交給阿米婭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她會走上一條很難的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會陪著她，巴別塔……會陪著她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很幼小，但足夠堅強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，我並非因為臨時起意才自私地將王冠留在巴別塔……留給她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要打破循環，應對即將到來的未來……魔王不能只是薩卡茲的魔王，魔王也不能成為泰拉的魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王不是枷鎖，不是統御，也不是無可匹敵的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王是鑰匙，是……“文明的存續”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要告訴阿米婭，凱爾希，她也不必現在就承擔這一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"踏上那條道路之後，她會明白，她也需要明白——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有戰勝所有的阻力，才能找到那扇通向大地的門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我將會消失在理想之中，而她……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她會成為燃盡所有腐朽的火焰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她將要離去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你們會是她所追尋理念的最後掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後的努力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劊子手們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要試圖放棄，在她的結局既定之前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向我證明，那條道路依舊有贏下未來的契機——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向她證明，你們所堅持的和平依舊可以得到回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但遺憾的是，我的同胞們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"償還血債的呼聲已經響徹在這片大地——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她的死亡已成定局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們失去了一位魔王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我失去了唯一的親人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我不會讓一切犧牲毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論你們為了和平，或是為了復仇而聚集於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會聽到你們的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們會看到薩卡茲真正的路在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們浸染維多利亞階梯的鮮血終有歸處——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，必須成為我們新的開始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"苦難會再次降臨——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全泰拉的屈服——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"會自此而起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——將浴火重生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要阻止他，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是……現在的巴別塔做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你總是會想出辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿米婭”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，在我們共同建立的巴別塔，你永遠不是一個人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殿下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭……！殿下……！殿下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……殿下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，我回來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"過去，我站在這裡時，迎接我的總是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這次……你不在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你還能聽到我的聲音嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不能再等等，殿下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……該死！該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要他們償還……我向你保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有參與的人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是他……哪怕是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老師……特雷西斯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他必須面對我……我……必須面對他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有的背叛……痛苦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭殿下……特雷西斯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我唯二的……我卻……"},{"type":"narration","text":"雲層遮住斜陽，陰影籠罩了阿斯卡綸。\n她再無陽光。再無信仰。\n她掙扎過了，她努力過了。\n只有死亡屬於風暴之子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g5_furnaceplatform"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_npc_1300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":"avg_npc_1310_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……Logos。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……我不知道……我們還是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先撤退吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Scout","speakerId":"avg_npc_1311_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先……回巴別塔去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孽茨雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_420_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何……我竟會……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也正奇怪呢，食腐者之王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜卡雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為我早就習慣了魔王之死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"……不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"誰*薩卡茲粗口*負責的通訊頻段？！是不是讓軍事委員會截了，開這種玩笑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信……我……你給我閉嘴！Scout！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"本艦……應該在這個方向！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭……怎麼會這麼容易就……就……死掉？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"898年冬，魔王死了。\n以勒什死在了卡茲戴爾毀滅之前。\n魂靈熔爐爆炸而揚起的粉塵在卡茲戴爾地區上空飄蕩了三天三夜……\n最終它們如黑色的雪花般落下。\n埋葬了侵略者的屍骨。\n也埋葬了那座曾名為“卡茲戴爾”的廢墟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾……不復存在了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但卡茲戴爾從未消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我從魔王那裡聽來的，他說，卡茲戴爾曾毀滅三千餘次，但最終都會被重建。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……說不定只是以勒什欺騙民眾的把戲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已經死了，特雷西斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可即使那是他在宮殿中庸碌無事時編撰的故事……至少在這些故事裡，我還能聽到一絲嚮往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對可能存在的，平穩生活的嚮往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勝利了之後呢，如今大家又將在這片土地上開始流浪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞們以英雄之名稱頌我們，我們卻只能還以一片了無生機的廢墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們又能做什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“英雄”……這場戰爭結束的那刻起，“英雄”便已毫無意義……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有……從剛才開始，我似乎一直有聽到眾魂的耳語……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們越發清晰了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道眾魂希望引導我去向何處……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本將這視作勝利時因興奮而產生的虛妄……但看來，不只如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眾魂在召喚你我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那走吧，無論何處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魔王以勒什長眠於此。\n在山巒般堆砌的屍骸之下。\n在更久遠的將來，無人會知曉，曾有一位王隕落於此。\n他如此平庸，如此普通。\n薩卡茲從不銘記失敗者。\n在這場改變薩卡茲命運的戰爭中，人們只會記得六個無比耀眼的英雄之名。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得這裡……以勒什的車輦崩毀之後，我們在這裡宣誓加入這場戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們的起點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個衣匠，一個衛士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你聽到了嗎，特雷西斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眾魂的聲音從我們的腳下傳來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是它呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，它這麼渺小。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"王冠。\n在死亡的見證之下——\n在眾魂的見證之下——\n雙子共同舉起了王冠。\n王冠同時選擇了雙子。\n廢墟之上，不知是否真實存在的眾魂，同時選定了兩種希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……由你來戴上這頂冠冕吧，特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"魔王不過是歷史選擇沉默時，屬於可憐人的一廂情願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……我們改變薩卡茲的命運，不需要借助一個既定的外力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但在這個絕望的時代，它會為我們的同胞帶回一絲希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我並不適合成為帶來希望的那個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的劍會開闢前路。而你來為我們指引方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭方才結束，這一次，我們又要肩負它到何時？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在重新找到安身的家園之前，在黑王冠的苦難將我們吞沒之前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在所有人能安然睡在同一片天空下之前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才提到了，“指引方向”，還記得我們以前那次冒險嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你握著劍，背著我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而你指引我從灌木中劈出回家的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特蕾西婭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"容我親手為你戴冠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會向所有薩卡茲宣誓……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
